{"3981460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Total Tank Simulator 2", "steam_appid": 3981460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make a mess. Then drive through it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The continuation of Total Tank Simulator returns with even more mayhem and destruction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Tank Simulator 2 is a far more advanced physics-driven battle sandbox where every structure, terrain, and unit is made of hundreds of breakable pieces. Cities crumble, trees splinter, tanks are shredded into tiny parts - because everything in the game is destroyable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/0180903207a15ac3c3489899d26b67e4.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/0180903207a15ac3c3489899d26b67e4.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/0180903207a15ac3c3489899d26b67e4.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>History, sci-fi, and fantasy collide.</i> Build dream (or nightmare) matchups: WW2 armor vs aliens, cyclops vs cyborgs, laser-equipped dinos vs… anything really. Each faction brings distinct toys and tactics to the battle playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/83b57bde6f2df50f0600abae34c22c98.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/83b57bde6f2df50f0600abae34c22c98.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/83b57bde6f2df50f0600abae34c22c98.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolish</strong> fully destructible environments and units built on our custom physics engine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the world crumble</strong> with satisfying chain reactions, collapses, and debris. <strong>Mix eras</strong> and pit historical, sci-fi, and fantasy factions against each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch perspective</strong> between commanding the whole team from a distance and taking direct control of any unit at any time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as you like</strong> - prove yourself in challenging campaigns and unlock new maps, factions and units, or play freely by creating your own matchups in various skirmish battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be creative</strong> - develop your own units, maps, and factions with our built-in modding tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/d1d84a5820eab2873aebf3e7694decf2.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/d1d84a5820eab2873aebf3e7694decf2.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/d1d84a5820eab2873aebf3e7694decf2.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Watch, command, or take direct control</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay out your formations, hit start, and watch the chaos. Command your entire team in the campaign mode, or freely manage any side and switch between them in skirmish mode. At any time, you can jump into the fight by taking direct control of any unit in Third-Person Perspective mode to experience the chaos yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/8c40829cbe59e94ab79667ce172fca69.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/8c40829cbe59e94ab79667ce172fca69.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/8c40829cbe59e94ab79667ce172fca69.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Made to be modded.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Steam Workshop support and built-in modding tools, download community creations or publish your own units, factions, maps, and scenarios in just a few clicks. TTS2 evolves the formula with a modern custom physics engine, fully breakable maps and units, cross-era factions beyond WW2, and Steam Workshop integration - while keeping the fan-favorite mix of sandbox creativity and direct unit control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/6251cc3abea34b3c1142f37454f8a76b.avif?t=1766428551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras_big/6251cc3abea34b3c1142f37454f8a76b.avif?t=1766428551 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Make a mess. Then drive through it.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The continuation of Total Tank Simulator returns with even more mayhem and destruction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total Tank Simulator 2 is a far more advanced physics-driven battle sandbox where every structure, terrain, and unit is made of hundreds of breakable pieces. Cities crumble, trees splinter, tanks are shredded into tiny parts - because everything in the game is destroyable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/0180903207a15ac3c3489899d26b67e4.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/0180903207a15ac3c3489899d26b67e4.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/0180903207a15ac3c3489899d26b67e4.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>History, sci-fi, and fantasy collide.</i> Build dream (or nightmare) matchups: WW2 armor vs aliens, cyclops vs cyborgs, laser-equipped dinos vs… anything really. Each faction brings distinct toys and tactics to the battle playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/83b57bde6f2df50f0600abae34c22c98.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/83b57bde6f2df50f0600abae34c22c98.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/83b57bde6f2df50f0600abae34c22c98.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolish</strong> fully destructible environments and units built on our custom physics engine. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch the world crumble</strong> with satisfying chain reactions, collapses, and debris. <strong>Mix eras</strong> and pit historical, sci-fi, and fantasy factions against each other.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Switch perspective</strong> between commanding the whole team from a distance and taking direct control of any unit at any time. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as you like</strong> - prove yourself in challenging campaigns and unlock new maps, factions and units, or play freely by creating your own matchups in various skirmish battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be creative</strong> - develop your own units, maps, and factions with our built-in modding tools.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/d1d84a5820eab2873aebf3e7694decf2.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/d1d84a5820eab2873aebf3e7694decf2.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/d1d84a5820eab2873aebf3e7694decf2.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Watch, command, or take direct control</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lay out your formations, hit start, and watch the chaos. Command your entire team in the campaign mode, or freely manage any side and switch between them in skirmish mode. At any time, you can jump into the fight by taking direct control of any unit in Third-Person Perspective mode to experience the chaos yourself! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/8c40829cbe59e94ab79667ce172fca69.poster.avif?t=1766428551\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/8c40829cbe59e94ab79667ce172fca69.webm?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/8c40829cbe59e94ab79667ce172fca69.mp4?t=1766428551\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Made to be modded.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With Steam Workshop support and built-in modding tools, download community creations or publish your own units, factions, maps, and scenarios in just a few clicks. TTS2 evolves the formula with a modern custom physics engine, fully breakable maps and units, cross-era factions beyond WW2, and Steam Workshop integration - while keeping the fan-favorite mix of sandbox creativity and direct unit control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras/6251cc3abea34b3c1142f37454f8a76b.avif?t=1766428551\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/extras_big/6251cc3abea34b3c1142f37454f8a76b.avif?t=1766428551 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A physics-based derpy battle simulator of total destruction. Build cross-era lineups, then command your team in RTS mode or jump straight into the action by taking direct control of any unit. Play unique and challenging campaigns, launch a quick skirmish or just relax and watch mayhem unfolding.", "supported_languages": "English, Polish, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/5bfe1729cc8f56da5f869d5f5b5272499d8d158b/header.jpg?t=1766428551", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/ff2e0f286816d37324430380c4c1bce546c096c2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766428551", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981460/ff2e0f286816d37324430380c4c1bce546c096c2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766428551", "website": "https://www.noobzfrompoland.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-11600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3060<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> yes</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i7-12700<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce RTX 3070<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 8 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> yes</li></ul>"}, "